      <dict>
        <key>boundary</key>
        <string>Two-cut prototype for encoded U0281, not a formal uppercase mapping. Actual phonetic identity, all-cut source/roles, reflected edge kerning and target-size spacing require separate review.</string>
        <key>construction</key>
        <string>Reflect the entire genuine same-cut SC R vertically in its own unsheared axis, returning it to the genuine italic axis. The left stem stays left, the bowl moves below and the defining branch moves above. Preserve every native curve/stroke/counter and native SC edge-bearing roles, with an advance for the actual reflected ink. No ordinary R alias, half-turn, capital reduction or synthetic italic.</string>
        <key>kerningBoundary</key>
        <string>The ordinary SC bodies are construction controls, not automatic new-glyph edge-kerning aliases. Preserve the stated actual outer-bearing policy and measure both edges/adjacent contexts; no forced correction cancels the reflected branch or defining crossbar.</string>
